<!-- KLIC native HTML example. Styles/interactions: component bundle. KLIC example; preserve bundled per-file license notices. -->
<div data-klic-component="alert-dialog" class="kn-alert-dialog"><button type="button" data-cmp-action="open-dialog"  data-part="btn" class="kv-neutral kv-sm">보관 전 확인</button><dialog data-part="confirm dialog"><h3>프로젝트를 보관할까요?</h3><p>목록에서 숨기는 동작을 시연합니다.<br>실제 프로젝트는 변경하지 않습니다.</p><form method="dialog"><button value="cancel" autofocus data-part="btn" class="kv-neutral kv-sm">취소</button><button value="confirm" data-part="btn" class="kv-sm">보관 확인</button></form></dialog><p data-cmp-status role="status" aria-live="polite" data-part="status"></p></div>
